# apps/api/Dockerfile's build context is the repo root (npm workspaces need
# every workspace's package.json — see the Dockerfile's header comment), so
# this file lives at the repo root too. Without it, `docker build`/`fly
# deploy` would upload every workspace's node_modules (hundreds of MB) as
# build context on every run.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.expo
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.vscode
